# ceiling_brake_stale_velocity_alt.expect — ALT_HOLD at the ceiling right after a long ToF-silence episode holds the height (7th pass, C1)
# 長い ToF 出力停止のエピソードの直後、天井で入れた ALT_HOLD は高さを保つ（7 回目、C1）
#
# ALT_HOLD at 13.0 s, 1.24 m: the height stays within +-0.15 m of the ceiling until the DISARM at 21 s (the 6th pass fell to 0.59 m).
# 13.0 s、1.24 m で ALT_HOLD: 21 s の DISARM まで、高さは天井の ±0.15 m 以内に保たれる（6 回目は 0.59 m まで落ちた）。
exit 0
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"
metric descent_speed_max < 1.0 in 13.0 20.5
metric alt_min > 1.05 in 13.5 20.5
metric alt_max < 1.35 in 13.5 20.5
